      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear you, and it makes complete sense that you feel this way—fighting for space to simply be yourself is exhausting, and that weight is real. You don’t have to keep pushing against everything all at once; it’s okay to set the battle down for a moment and just breathe. Maybe the next step isn’t about changing the world, but about giving yourself permission to rest, even if it’s just for today. You’re not weak for feeling heavy—you’re human, and you’ve been carrying more than anyone should have to.",
