      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks... but it's more than just being tired. it feels like there's no actual point. like even if i \"rest\", everything is still gonna be the same when i wake up. it's like i'm running a race with no finish line and everyone is just watching me fail. sometimes i think maybe i was just never meant to be part of this world.",
